@AddsEats.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5187

### Get all restaurants (with optional pagination and filtering)
GET {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/restaurant?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Get restaurant by ID
GET {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/restaurant/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get menu of a specific restaurant
GET {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/restaurant/1/menu
Accept: application/json

###

### Get menu of non-existent restaurant (returns 404)
GET {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/restaurant/999/menu
Accept: application/json

###

### Get all menu items
GET {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/menuitem
Accept: application/json

###

### Get menu item by ID
GET {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/menuitem/1
Accept: application/json

###
